METADATA {'name': 'CMMLU', 'description': 'Chinese multiple-choice knowledge questions with complete OpenCompass model predictions and a versioned reconstruction of option-extraction accuracy.', 'testing_condition': "Preserve all 254,804 records from 22 reported system labels and 67 question categories. Items contain each exact recorded prompt, including CoT/no-CoT instructions and source formatting defects, with only surrounding whitespace trimmed; traces preserve the exact original prompt including trailing newlines. Repeated prompts remain separate attempts. The HF release contains predictions and gold options, but no historical grades or full run configurations. Responses are reconstructed using the pinned OpenCompass match_answer_pattern and AccEvaluator reference protocol; they are not claimed to reproduce the original leaderboard. This parser selects the first matching answer after an ASCII colon, preserves the captured letter's case, and gives an unmatched output zero. Consequently, a semantically correct answer with a full-width colon can fail this format-sensitive statistic. Do not interpret it as independently verified semantic correctness. No model inference or LLM judging is performed. Two source labels, rlhf-lmdeploy and sft-s2-lmdeploy, do not identify a public model checkpoint.", 'modality': ['text'], 'item_type': 'question', 'subject_type': 'model', 'response_type': 'binary', 'license': 'CMMLU questions use CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0; the OpenCompass prediction release does not declare a separate license.', 'release': 'public'}
SOURCE_COUNTS {'source_responses': 254804, 'source_subjects': 22, 'source_items': 23160, 'source_traces': 254804, 'source_categories': 67, 'source_repeated_attempts': 44, 'source_empty_predictions': 3, 'source_unmatched_predictions': 15683, 'source_successes': 180870, 'source_failures': 73934}

