in Equation 2 according to the distribution of
model confidences in the correct label of the cor-
responding test set. We compute four accuracy
metrics: (1) accuracy on original examples in the
PARANLU (AO), (2) accuracy on the test set of the
original dataset ( AT), (3) accuracy on all para-
phrases across all buckets (A
 ), and (4) corrected
accuracy on all paraphrases across all buckets
( ~A
 ) which is weighted in the same manner as
~PC to undo stratification effects.
Table 4 shows these accuracy metrics along
